### Get all books
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/books

### Get one book by index
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/books/0

### Get out-of-range index (expect 404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/books/99

### Post a new book
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018
}